NOTE ON THIRD-PARTY SOURCES: this repository curates values from published
literature, regulatory documents, and patents. Underlying third-party full texts
are referenced (DOI/PMID/patent number), never redistributed. Each data row
records its rights status in the `redistribution` column: `public_domain` for
US patents and US/EU regulatory documents, `summary_stat` for values used as
summary statistics, and `verify` where rights are unresolved.
